        "delivery_shape": "faithful same-TU standard-clock route",
        "algorithm": "Seastar steady_clock_type precise timer route, an alias of std::chrono::steady_clock, followed by equivalent typed conversion, elapsed and saturating deadline arithmetic",
        "source_file": "include/seastar/core/timer.hh",
        "source": "clean external checkout"
      }
    }
  ],
  "strata": [
    {
